  {
   "id": "first-snow-132765@patch-2021-10-26",
   "gameId": "first-snow-132765",
   "displayName": "Partial VO Patch Details",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-10-26T17:55:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone! We wanted to give a quick rundown on the upcoming update for First Snow.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "First, the trailer",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Before the end of the year, we'll be adding partial VO to First Snow with casting and directing from Studio Coattails! Here's the cast list:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Allison: Elizabeth Quedenfeld",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eileen: Kira Buckland",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rose: Nola Klop",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Caprice: Lisa Reimold",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Millie: Jill Harris",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hayley: Elissa Park",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wallace: Steven Kelly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Eve: Aimee Smith",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Andrew: Bradley Gareth",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elizabeth: Abigail Turner",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update will provide full voice acting to the CGs as well as some important lines in the story, with the rest of the visual novel using short, repeatable voice clips. We think the entire cast did a fantastic job, and we can't wait for you to hear them all soon!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Alongside the update, we plan to drop a handful of merch on the Studio Elan store! We'll provide more details here once the patch drops, but here's a small preview of the keychains in the set:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A small warning: this update will likely cause issues with your saves. In the event your save breaks, an icon should appear on that save slot to confirm it's broken. The only real solution will be starting a new game and quickly skipping back to where you were. We're extremely sorry for the inconvenience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
